    "expectedRule": "Redaction Scriptorium tracks three clause desks (body_clause_desk 肉身, memory_clause_desk 记忆, return_clause_desk 归返). Clearing a clause desk opens a pending clause choice that blocks departure (终稿条款尚未裁定，请先选择认证或删改。) until the player resolves law/resolve-redaction-clause; certify costs no HP and logs 终稿条款·认证：认证当前正文，不支付生命。, while redact costs 8% of max HP (floor, min 1) and logs 终稿条款·删改：支付最大生命 8%（N 点）并删除当前条款。. Redact is unavailable when current HP is not above the cost (当前生命不足以支付删改代价。) and resolving without a pending choice is rejected 当前没有待裁定的终稿条款。; re-selecting a cleared desk is rejected already-resolved. Route gates: redaction_clause_certified gates (redaction_memory_north_entry, redaction_memory_upper_entry, redaction_body_censor_entry, redaction_body_upper_entry, redaction_return_south_entry, redaction_return_lower_entry) open only when the matching clause was certified; redacting the clause closes the sector permanently with block reason 对应条款必须选择认证；删改后该选区永久关闭。 and removes the edge from legal adjacent targets so run/move through it is rejected illegal-move. The four last_redactor approaches (redaction_final_proof_boss_gate, redaction_north_boss_gate, redaction_side_boss_gate, redaction_south_boss_gate) need all three clauses resolved (肉身、记忆与归返三份条款全部裁定后开放。), redact counting as resolved. Starting the last_redactor boss combat snapshots the resolved clause choices into bossClauseSnapshot, clears the pending clause, and freezes further changes (首领终稿已经冻结，不能再改写条款。); the display shows 冻结条款 N/3. Boss modifiers derive only from the snapshot during boss encounters: body certify grants the boss +10% defense (sealed) / +20% (awakened), memory certify grants +10% / +20% artPower, return certify applies -10% / -20% healing and guardEffect to the player; redacted clauses contribute 0. The redlineEdge, palimpsestMantle, and finalProofSeal entry passives halve the respective percents. Healing pill heals 36 base, scaled by healingPercent (29 at -20% awakened, 36 at 0%). Display severity is danger while a clause is pending, warning with unresolved desks, resolved when all three are resolved or the boss snapshot is frozen. Law state persists through a save-codec round-trip. All expected values are frozen here, never read from candidate code."
  },
